OL,6,     FOutback legend Steve Grahame is
OL,7,     Fhauling three million dollars'
OL,8,     Fworth of vital power generating
OL,9,     Fequipment to Kalumburu, an
OL,10,     Fisolated community in the far
OL,11,     FNorth West of Australia.
OL,12,G0210 Outback Truckers
OL,13,     FIt's mid-afternoon in Perth and
OL,14,     FDion's super size convoy is
OL,15,     Fpushing hard to get out of the
OL,16,     Fcity before sunset. And the fate
OL,17,     Fof Steve's trip hangs on one phone
OL,18,     Fcall to his mechanic.
